   "html": "<p>We partnered with Starline Tours to bring guests into the seedy Hollywood world of Cliff Booth through a custom mis-adventures bus tour that blended historical storytelling and unexpected surprises.</p><p>The tour offered a unique and compelling perspective of Cliff Booth’s world ahead of the film’s premiere. Guests experienced a mix of behind-the-scenes Hollywood insights and visual moments designed for capture, with a mid-way F&amp;B stop at a local tiki bar.</p>"
